<th id="S4.T1.3.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb"><span id="S4.T1.3.9.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">+ SFT (MDLM)</span></th>
