<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span><span id="S4.T3.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Qwen-A2D evaluation results.</span> MDLM and BD3LM models are evaluated with <span id="S4.T3.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">dLLM</span>’s pipeline; Autoregressive Qwen2.5/Qwen3 baselines are reported by original sources <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib44" title="" class="ltx_ref">Qwen Team et al., 2024</a>; <a href="#bib.bib45" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yang et al., 2025</a>)</cite>. See Figure <a href="#A1.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ Appendix A Training Curves ‣ dLLM: Simple Diffusion Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> for training curves.</figcaption>
</figure>
